"time": 1298.53, "timestamp": "00:21:38", "text": "星星。所以，某種程度上是這樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1299.917, "timestamp": "00:21:39", "text": "我該怎麼做？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1306.206, "timestamp": "00:21:46", "text": "慾望。所以，米高梅。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1308.109, "timestamp": "00:21:48", "text": "新型號。問候，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1309.258, "timestamp": "00:21:49", "text": "阿拉伯語。是的，新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1310.216, "timestamp": "00:21:50", "text": "模型最終"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1315.24, "timestamp": "00:21:55", "text": "出來了。所以，三年 哥們兒。這款模型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1317.174, "timestamp": "00:21:57", "text": "哥們兒。這款模型 最後。所以，他"}]